title: 'Marathon 2026-10-20 wrap: state of Gnomon at push'
summary: |-
  feat/gnomon pushed with ~90 commits from the overnight marathon. Everything merged was Aegis-reviewed and approved, several pieces after a BLOCK.
  MERGED (live after the founder restarts onto this build):
  (1) Read-only parity. The anchored cwd proof, grammar coverage, git read-only subcommands, the read-only pass in ask mode, the MAINTAIN env, "always" matching on the command, and miss logging. The C1 heredoc bypass and H1 git-config exec were found by Aegis, reproduced, and fixed.
  (2) Notify-not-ask F2–F6:
    - folder-scope modes;
    - a device-bound unlock of up to 12 h (the helper is held at 1.6.0 limits until 1.7.0 is signed);
    - a one-prompt daily standing grant with a notify feed and Revoke;
    - an unlock-joined toast;
    - the F3 default (needs a root-signed config).
    clientApiId moved once, to 795b3425….
  (3) Voice: capture states, the real level, and live words (a verified-speaker ghost line, never logged); decodeAsync with a watchdog. T-2026-10-20-005 done.
  (4) The Atelier GUI, all five slices: materials, desk, cards and pile, motion, Workshop caps. Plus the fixture preview harness.
  (5) Mods: K0 panels, the K2 usage feed behind log.read:usage, and the Ledger mod.
  (6) The stale-tab relaunch on a new port (the H1 port squat was fixed).
  IN FLIGHT: the Paradigm Context mod in worktree agent-a55d2eac28b152613. K1 projector, K3 focus, falsifiers and the mod package are committed; the GUI fixture is uncommitted; no Aegis review yet.
  FOUNDER-ONLY: re-sign and notarize helper 1.7.0; root-sign runModes.default; release the plugin from main (maxTurns 100: builders hit the 50-turn cap ~15 times). Tasks T-2026-10-20-006…009.
  KNOWN GAPS: no kernel source for the voice countdown; knot/incident titles stay quoted (raiser-composed); Ledger cost may be cumulative; the Workshop region is bound by name.
  HOUSEKEEPING: free disk was down to 1.7 GB. Removed 71 merged, clean worktrees (~28 GB; the only uncommitted files were hook logs) → 32 GB free. Branches kept.
